    <string name="gen_title">Engeza ukungahleleki okuncane</string>
    <string name="gen_body">Ifoni yakho isivele idale imbewu ephephile. Yinyakazise — noma udwebe kuphedi — ukuze uhlanganise i-entropy eyengeziwe kusuka kuzinzwa zokunyakaza nokuguquguquka kwesikhathi. Ngenxa yokuqapha.</string>
