    <string name="dialog_reveal_body">Umusho wokubuyisela (nomushwana wokungena, uma usethile owodwa) uyinto kuphela engabuyisela lesi sikhwama — futhi noma ubani onawo angasebenzisa izimali zakho. Wembule kuphela endaweni eyimfihlo, kungekho muntu obukayo. Isikrini esilandelayo sivimba izithombe-skrini.</string>
